{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10745","headline":"劒门 · 杜甫","name":"劒门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟天有设险，劒门天下壮。\n连山抱西南，石角皆北向。\n两崖崇墉倚，刻画城郭状。\n一夫怒临关，百万未可傍。\n珠玉走中原，岷峨气凄怆。\n三皇五帝前，鸡犬各相放。\n後王尚柔远，职贡道已丧。\n至今英雄人，高视见霸王。\n幷吞与割据，极力不相让。\n吾将罪真宰，意欲铲叠嶂。\n恐此复偶然，临风默惆怅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}